Native Go port of the expression grammar and workflow template reader from
https://github.com/actions/languageservices

Reference revision: 4043eda158e16579cc5fb1b0b07a4bce2a76f0b5
Official parser packages used by the conformance suite: 0.3.61

workflow-v1.0.json is copied unchanged from that revision.
testdata/conformance.json contains inputs from upstream expressions/testdata
and workflow-parser/testdata/reader, with expectations recorded by the official
JavaScript parsers. Reader fixtures larger than 100,000 bytes are excluded;
local boundary cases cover expression length and depth limits.

